\begin{proof}[Proof of \cref{thm.root unity}]
Consider any $1$-dimensional complex subspace $V$ of $\mathbb{C}^n$.
Since $V$ is invariant under the action of $C_r$, it follows that $V/C_r$ is a sub-metric space of $\mathbb{C}^n/C_r$, and so
