\leq \sum_{i=1}^r \sigma_i(X)\sigma_i(Y)\sigma_i(V_XV_Y^T),
\]
as well as the following multivariate version of Bernoulli's inequality:
\[
\prod_{i=1}^r(1+x_i)
\geq1+\sum_{i=1}^r x_i,
\]
which holds when all the $x_i$'s have the same sign and are at least $-1$.
First,
