    \includegraphics[width=1\columnwidth]{band_structure.pdf}
    \caption{(a-c) The band structure of two spin excitations are shown for $J_2 = 0,~0.1$, and $0.4$, respectively. (Inset) the isolated band in (b) is zoomed-in for clarity. For all the calculations, we fix $L=50$, $J_1=1$, and $J_z=10$.}
