 integration here takes place over that three-dimensional space-like volume $\Sigma$ in which the velocities $\vec v$ are determined, i.e., in principle over any three-dimensional space-like volume. Precisely this arbitrariness of $\Sigma$ is obviously one of the characteristics of a particle, see Figure~\ref{mitbewegt}.
