    \centering
    \includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{images/RBM_4to1.5.png}
    \caption{Quench $g=(4 \to 1.5)$ simulated using atVMC with a RBM ansatz with density $d=3$ on a TFI chain of $32$ spins. Simulations are performed with an adaptive time-step scheme, both with (circular markers) and without (triangular markers) collective parameter updates. (a) Transverse magnetization per spin: atVMC results compared to the exact solution (dashed line). Error bars are omitted as they are smaller than the marker size. (b) Number of active variational parameters selected by the adaptive algorithm. (c) Squared LITE during the evolution, compared to the target threshold (horizontal dashed line).}
