 In Section  \ref{sec-pre}, we introduce some notations and list several Lemmas that will be frequently used;
 Section \ref{sec-global existence} proves the global existence and stability;
 Section \ref{sec-decay} is devoted to the decay estimates of (\ref{fene}).

  \section{Preliminaries}\label{sec-pre}
