\caption{Field lines of a charge initially at rest (segments from an external region), that undergoes a uniform tangential acceleration along the circle, in a counter-clockwise direction (producing the intermediate curvilinear segments), culminating in a uniform motion with \mbox{$\beta_T=0.7$} and and a total angular deflection \mbox{$\varphi_T=3\pi/4$} (segments from an internal region).}
