Assumption \ref{assumption: penalty} corresponds to Assumption (C1) of \cite{keribin00sankhya}, specifying conditions for penalty functions. The BIC penalty function, given by \( p_{n,k} = \frac{k}{2}\log(n) \), satisfies this assumption, whereas the AIC penalty function, \( p_{n,k} = k\), does not satisfy Assumption \ref{assumption: penalty}(b).



