\frac{1}{2} \sum_{t=1}^T \left( \gamma_{1t} H^{3*}_{1t} + \sum_{s \neq t} \gamma_{1t} H^{1*}_{1t} \left( \gamma_{1s} H^{2*}_{1s}  + \gamma_{2s} H^{2*}_{2s} \right) \right)\\
