In extracting some attributes, such as \texttt{code\_snippet}, \texttt{code\_line\_count}, and \texttt{image}, we implemented regular expressions (RegEx) - a fundamental concept in formal language theory~\cite{chen2022solving}. The applied RegEx formats are as follows:

