\subsection{Leading eigenvectors of generalized transfer matrices}
We use the ideas summarized above to find leading eigenvectors of
$\mathbb{W}_{\beta,t}^{(\pm)}$. We again assume an MPO representation similar
to~\eref{eq:defAnstazFPmpo},
